<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns one secondary credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns one secondary credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed the single credit auction in the secondary market whereby it sought to inject 2.110 billion pesos.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTION   TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    2.110  bln pesos 3 days    31.03  pct</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
